-- Georgian real estate (Tbilisi/Batumi). Every canonical_url below was found
-- via live web search pointing to a real, currently-existing group/channel —
-- none are guessed or synthesized. member_count is set only where a source
-- actually reported one; otherwise left null rather than fabricated.
